---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<section id="features" class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 sm:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-3xl text-left mb-12 sm:mb-16">
    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mb-4">
      Layanan Utama Ibadah Harian
    </h2>
    <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
      Dua pilar ibadah utama kaum muslimin yang dirancang secara presisi, bebas dari iklan komersial, dan berlandaskan rujukan terpercaya.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Primary Pillars: Asymmetrical Editorial Pair -->
  <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 sm:gap-8 mb-10">
    <!-- Pillar 1: Jadwal Sholat (Deep Tone Anchor) -->
    <a
      href="/jadwal-sholat"
      class="group lg:col-span-7 bg-emerald-800 text-white rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-emerald-900 transition-colors"
    >
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-200">
          <Icon name="tabler:clock" class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-300" />
          <span>Waktu Ibadah Presisi</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">
          Jadwal Sholat & Imsakiyah 500+ Kota
        </h3>
        <p class="text-emerald-100/90 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-lg">
          Data hisab dan rukyat resmi Kementerian Agama RI dengan deteksi lokasi otomatis, hitung mundur waktu azan berikutnya, serta pengingat sholat sunnah dhuha & syuruq.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-8 flex items-center text-sm font-semibold text-amber-300 group-hover:text-amber-200 transition-colors">
        <span>Buka Jadwal Sholat Hari Ini</span>
        <Icon name="tabler:arrow-right" class="w-4 h-4 ml-1.5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true" />
      </div>
    </a>

    <!-- Pillar 2: Al-Qur'an 30 Juz (Tone Step Surface) -->
    <a
      href="/quran"
      class="group lg:col-span-5 bg-emerald-50/70 text-gray-900 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-emerald-100/80 transition-colors"
    >
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-800">
          <Icon name="tabler:book-2" class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-700" />
          <span>Mushaf & Murottal</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900">
          Al-Qur'an 30 Juz & Audio
        </h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          Teks mushaf standar Indonesia, terjemahan lengkap Kemenag, asbabun nuzul, tafsir wajiz, dan lantunan murottal dari 6 qari terkemuka.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-8 flex items-center text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-800 group-hover:text-emerald-950 transition-colors">
        <span>Mulai Membaca Al-Qur'an</span>
        <Icon name="tabler:arrow-right" class="w-4 h-4 ml-1.5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true" />
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>

  <!-- Supporting Resources: Unboxed 4-Column Editorial Flow -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 pt-4 text-left">
    <!-- Doa Harian -->
    <a
      href="/doa"
      class="group p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50/70 hover:bg-emerald-50/60 transition-colors flex flex-col justify-between"
    >
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-800">Hisnul Muslim</div>
        <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors">
          Kumpulan Doa Harian
        </h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Kompilasi doa mustajab bersumber dari hadits shahih lengkap dengan teks Arab, latin, dan artinya.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-4 flex items-center text-xs font-semibold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors">
        <span>Buka Kumpulan Doa</span>
        <Icon name="tabler:arrow-right" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 ml-1 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" />
      </div>
    </a>

    <!-- Info Kajian -->
    <a
      href="/kajian"
      class="group p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50/70 hover:bg-emerald-50/60 transition-colors flex flex-col justify-between"
    >
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-800">Majelis Ilmu</div>
        <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors">
          Info Kajian Sunnah
        </h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Jadwal agenda kajian Islam ilmiah dari berbagai masjid dan majelis ilmu di kota-kota se-Indonesia.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-4 flex items-center text-xs font-semibold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors">
        <span>Lihat Agenda Kajian</span>
        <Icon name="tabler:arrow-right" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 ml-1 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" />
      </div>
    </a>

    <!-- Artikel & Panduan -->
    <a
      href="/artikel"
      class="group p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50/70 hover:bg-emerald-50/60 transition-colors flex flex-col justify-between"
    >
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-800">Fikih & Akhlak</div>
        <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors">
          Artikel & Panduan Sholat
        </h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Panduan praktis tata cara sholat, sifat sholat nabi, adab dzikir, dan kiat menjaga kekhusyukan.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-4 flex items-center text-xs font-semibold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors">
        <span>Baca Panduan</span>
        <Icon name="tabler:arrow-right" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 ml-1 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" />
      </div>
    </a>

    <!-- Tanya Al-Quran -->
    <button
      type="button"
      onclick="document.getElementById('quran-chat-toggle')?.click();"
      class="group text-left p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50/70 hover:bg-emerald-50/60 transition-colors flex flex-col justify-between cursor-pointer w-full"
    >
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-800">Pencarian Tematik</div>
        <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors">
          Tanya Al-Qur'an & Dalil
        </h4>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
          Temukan ayat, tafsir, dan doa yang relevan berdasarkan topik ibadah yang sedang kamu pelajari.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="pt-4 flex items-center text-xs font-semibold text-gray-900 group-hover:text-emerald-800 transition-colors">
        <span>Tanya Sekarang</span>
        <Icon name="tabler:arrow-right" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 ml-1 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" />
      </div>
    </button>
  </div>
</section>
